1:["$","main",null,{"className":"site article-page","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"article-frame","children":[["$","a",null,{"className":"desktop-brand","href":"/","children":["$","span",null,{"className":"letter-cascade is-in","aria-label":"Thinkinghaus","children":[["$","b","T-0",{"aria-hidden":"true","style":{"--letter-cascade-index":0},"children":"T"}],["$","b","h-1",{"aria-hidden":"true","style":{"--letter-cascade-index":1},"children":"h"}],["$","b","i-2",{"aria-hidden":"true","style":{"--letter-cascade-index":2},"children":"i"}],["$","b","n-3",{"aria-hidden":"true","style":{"--letter-cascade-index":3},"children":"n"}],["$","b","k-4",{"aria-hidden":"true","style":{"--letter-cascade-index":4},"children":"k"}],["$","b","i-5",{"aria-hidden":"true","style":{"--letter-cascade-index":5},"children":"i"}],["$","b","n-6",{"aria-hidden":"true","style":{"--letter-cascade-index":6},"children":"n"}],["$","b","g-7",{"aria-hidden":"true","style":{"--letter-cascade-index":7},"children":"g"}],["$","b","h-8",{"aria-hidden":"true","style":{"--letter-cascade-index":8},"children":"h"}],["$","b","a-9",{"aria-hidden":"true","style":{"--letter-cascade-index":9},"children":"a"}],["$","b","u-10",{"aria-hidden":"true","style":{"--letter-cascade-index":10},"children":"u"}],["$","b","s-11",{"aria-hidden":"true","style":{"--letter-cascade-index":11},"children":"s"}]]}]}],["$","article",null,{"className":"article-column","data-content-slug":"work-between-the-work","data-content-title":"Work between the work","children":[["$","header",null,{"className":"article-header","children":[["$","h1",null,{"children":"Work between the work"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"July 20, 2026"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"3 minute read"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"author-edit-action","hidden":true,"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"https://thinkinghaus-studio.maxpfennighaus.workers.dev/","children":"Edit"}]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"article-body","children":[[["$","p","0-Some of the most useful work I do leaves almost nothing behind.",{"className":"$undefined","children":["Some of the most useful work I do leaves almost nothing behind."]}],["$","p","1-A portfolio is a strangely hygienic account of a project. Here is a report. Here is an identity, a platform, a system. Everything appears as a finished object, as if it arrived intact on a white background.",{"className":"$undefined","children":["A portfolio is a strangely hygienic account of a project. Here is a report. Here is an identity, a platform, a system. Everything appears as a finished object, as if it arrived intact on a white background."]}],["$","p","2-What disappears are the people, budgets, old decisions, new anxieties, unclear language, and deadlines that don’t care whether the idea is ready. The conversation before the meeting. The question that changes the brief. The note three days later explaining why everyone agreed to the thing they’ve already started forgetting.",{"className":"$undefined","children":["What disappears are the people, budgets, old decisions, new anxieties, unclear language, and deadlines that don’t care whether the idea is ready. The conversation before the meeting. The question that changes the brief. The note three days later explaining why everyone agreed to the thing they’ve already started forgetting."]}],["$","p","3-For a long time, I thought of all of this as the stuff surrounding the work. The real work was what I could see. That got harder to believe as I started leading more projects.",{"className":"$undefined","children":["For a long time, I thought of all of this as the stuff surrounding the work. The real work was what I could see. That got harder to believe as I started leading more projects."]}],["$","p","4-A lot of the invisible part is translation. Someone says they want “more impact.” Maybe they mean contrast. Maybe confidence. Maybe they’re worried the CEO is going to flip past the page without noticing it. The request and the actual worry are often two different animals, and asking one more question can keep a room full of people from spending a week solving the wrong problem in excruciating detail.",{"className":"$undefined","children":"$Le"}],"$Lf","$L10","$L11","$L12","$L13","$L14","$L15","$L16"],null,"$L17"]}],"$L18","$L19"]}]]}]}]
1a:I["0852856a0d0c",[],"Footer",1]
e:["A lot of the invisible part is translation. Someone says they want “more impact.” Maybe they mean contrast. Maybe confidence. Maybe they’re worried the CEO is going to flip past the page without noticing it. The request and the actual worry are often two different animals, and asking one more question can keep a room full of people from spending a week solving the wrong problem in excruciating detail."]
f:["$","p","5-Timing matters in similarly annoying ways. Show rough work as though it’s finished and people will judge everything that isn’t there yet. Show finished work as though it’s still an open question and somebody will helpfully pull the legs off it.",{"className":"$undefined","children":["Timing matters in similarly annoying ways. Show rough work as though it’s finished and people will judge everything that isn’t there yet. Show finished work as though it’s still an open question and somebody will helpfully pull the legs off it."]}]
10:["$","p","6-None of this produces much to point at afterward.",{"className":"$undefined","children":["None of this produces much to point at afterward."]}]
11:["$","p","7-There were days when I’d leave work having made almost nothing myself. I’d clarified a decision, connected two people, moved something out of somebody’s way, given a designer another afternoon before showing the work, or written down enough context that the next person didn’t have to reconstruct the whole archaeological site from Slack messages.",{"className":"$undefined","children":["There were days when I’d leave work having made almost nothing myself. I’d clarified a decision, connected two people, moved something out of somebody’s way, given a designer another afternoon before showing the work, or written down enough context that the next person didn’t have to reconstruct the whole archaeological site from Slack messages."]}]
12:["$","p","8-At first, those days made me vaguely guilty. I like making things. I like the clean evidence of a page changing under my hands. “I helped several conversations go better” has considerably less portfolio appeal. But I’ve come to think that making the conditions for good work is part of making the work.",{"className":"$undefined","children":["At first, those days made me vaguely guilty. I like making things. I like the clean evidence of a page changing under my hands. “I helped several conversations go better” has considerably less portfolio appeal. But I’ve come to think that making the conditions for good work is part of making the work."]}]
13:["$","p","9-That doesn’t mean every meeting is secretly design. Plenty of meetings are just meetings. Coordination can become its own enormous inflatable industry where everybody spends all day discussing the work nobody has time to do.",{"className":"$undefined","children":["That doesn’t mean every meeting is secretly design. Plenty of meetings are just meetings. Coordination can become its own enormous inflatable industry where everybody spends all day discussing the work nobody has time to do."]}]
14:["$","p","10-The useful version is quieter. Somebody understands why a decision was made instead of merely being told what it was. A good idea gets another day rather than being killed because it was shown too early. A person can move forward without waiting for three more people to weigh in. The project has a little less friction in it.",{"className":"$undefined","children":["The useful version is quieter. Somebody understands why a decision was made instead of merely being told what it was. A good idea gets another day rather than being killed because it was shown too early. A person can move forward without waiting for three more people to weigh in. The project has a little less friction in it."]}]
15:["$","p","11-Most of the evidence is indirect. Fewer surprises. Calmer handoffs. Decisions that still make sense a week later. Somebody else being able to pick up the thing without needing you standing beside them.",{"className":"$undefined","children":["Most of the evidence is indirect. Fewer surprises. Calmer handoffs. Decisions that still make sense a week later. Somebody else being able to pick up the thing without needing you standing beside them."]}]
16:["$","p","12-I still prefer the days when I make something I can see. But I no longer think those are the only days that count.",{"className":"$undefined","children":["I still prefer the days when I make something I can see. But I no longer think those are the only days that count."]}]
